<metadata><name>Day 55 (stop 2 of 2) - Tall Pines, Rocksprings</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.561832" lon="-80.878567"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on Sideroad 15, limited parking is available at the end of the road just…. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.563413" lon="-80.871580"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Rocksprings Side Trail, heading north-west. (the blue-blazed Tall Pines Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.565842" lon="-80.869661"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn sharp left onto the blue-blazed Tall Pines Side Trail, heading north. (the blue-blazed Tall Pines Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.570395" lon="-80.876389"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: End of the Tall Pines Side Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
